#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_LANG_LIBRARY_PATH_FLAG.rst:2
msgid "CMAKE_<LANG>_LIBRARY_PATH_FLAG"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_LANG_LIBRARY_PATH_FLAG.rst:6
msgid ""
"The flag to be used to add a library search path to the linker for the "
"toolchain of language ``<LANG>``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_LANG_LIBRARY_PATH_FLAG.rst:9
msgid ""
"CMake sets this variable automatically for some toolchains during toolchain "
"inspection by calls to the :command:`project` or :command:`enable_language` "
"commands."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_LANG_LIBRARY_PATH_FLAG.rst:13
msgid ""
"If the :variable:`!CMAKE_<LANG>_LIBRARY_PATH_FLAG` variable is defined, it "
"takes precedence over the language-agnostic :variable:"
"`CMAKE_LIBRARY_PATH_FLAG` variable."
msgstr ""
